WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.409
VERIGA checks the links of a website. Here, a small site of five files on disk.

00:00:08.963 --> 00:00:17.683
One command crawls the site and also looks for orphan files. Exit code 2 tells scripts that broken links were found.

00:00:21.589 --> 00:00:27.332
The text report lists the broken links first. Here a page and an image are missing.

00:00:30.624 --> 00:00:38.099
The same result also comes out as a CSV table, ready for a spreadsheet. The orphan file is listed too.

00:00:41.537 --> 00:00:47.931
The language of the reports is chosen with the lang option. Here, the same check, in English.
